<title>BELARUS: Belarus rouble edged down to 15,500 per dlr in Min.</title>
<headline>Belarus rouble edged down to 15,500 per dlr in Min.</headline>
<dateline>MINSK 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belarussian rouble edged down to 15,500 per dollar on the Minsk Interbank Currency Exchange from 15,450 at the previous session.</p>
<p>				    December 13	 December 12</p>
<p> Rate to dollar		    15,500		15,450</p>
<p> Volume traded		  $19.316 million	 $7.977 million</p>
<p>--Kiev newsroom, +380 44 229 2264</p>
